  emit ts in baked mode cannot generate a dependent value outside a record field (in a map, a literal union, or a value or result of its own); hold the value in a record field beside its discriminant

error[E8019]  a/a.canon:54:5
  emit ts in baked mode cannot generate a dependent value outside a record field (in a map, a literal union, or a value or result of its own); hold the value in a record field beside its discriminant

error[E8019]  a/a.canon:57:5
  emit ts in baked mode cannot generate a dependent value decided through a ref, an optional or a record parameter; not before v0.2: decide it by an enum field of the same record meanwhile

3 errors, 0 warnings in 1 package (…)
